WEBVTT

00:02:29.452 --> 00:02:31.832
(Cheers)

00:02:31.856 --> 00:02:33.317
(Laughter)

00:02:33.341 --> 00:02:34.572
Listen, OK.

00:02:34.596 --> 00:02:40.325
Created by Joe Casey and Nick Dragotta
for the Marvel miniseries "Vengeance,"

00:02:40.349 --> 00:02:43.221
America Chavez has been
in the Marvel Universe

00:02:43.245 --> 00:02:44.777
for over seven years.

00:02:45.182 --> 00:02:47.193
She's tough, Latina,

00:02:47.217 --> 00:02:51.391
and she's so strong that she can punch
portals into other dimensions.

00:02:51.415 --> 00:02:52.503
(Laughter)

00:02:52.527 --> 00:02:53.758
I know, right?

00:02:53.782 --> 00:02:55.067
(Laughter)

00:02:55.091 --> 00:02:56.766
And people were so excited,

00:02:56.790 --> 00:03:01.441
because finally, someone who shared
her identities -- queer and Latina --